================================================================================
Third-party components bundled in this repository
================================================================================

1) Agent Lightning  ->  third_party/agentlightning/
   Upstream: https://github.com/microsoft/agent-lightning
   Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation.
   License: MIT (see third_party/agentlightning/LICENSE).

   This is a vendored snapshot of Agent Lightning (version string 0.3.1), which
   is not available on PyPI, with local modifications required by LadderSQL's
   multi-turn training loop. Modified sites are marked with inline comments in
   the following files:
     - verl/trainer.py      (adds a step-reward training variant, weight logging)
     - verl/daemon.py, verl/dataset.py, verl/entrypoint.py, verl/config.yaml
     - runner/agent.py      (reward span propagation)
     - tracer/dummy.py, algorithm/apo/apo.py, __init__.py
   All Microsoft copyright headers are retained.

2) Spider evaluation scripts  ->  training/reward_func/spider_eval/
   Derived from the official Spider benchmark evaluation code
   (https://github.com/taoyds/spider) and its execution-accuracy variants,
   used here to compute execution-based rewards and metrics.

================================================================================
External code not included
================================================================================

APEX-SQL: the Bird schema-linking stage reproduces APEX-SQL, whose source is
obtained from its own authors and is NOT redistributed here. This repository
only ships the driver scripts under schema_construction/apex_sql_runner/ that
invoke it. See docs/01_schema_construction.md.
